```mdl
verdict ImportSpec: An ImportSpec with this key exists, but it links a local-checkout file by source key, not the FileMapping import contract.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-code/src/types/CodeOperation.ts#ImportSpec, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-code/src/operations/import-spec.ts]
  note: |
    Input is `{ key }` (`github:<owner>/<repo>/<path>`) and output `{ spec, created }`. The handler returns a Spec
    already carrying the key, else reads the file from a configured local checkout and creates the Spec. It takes no
    `content`, `base` or `heads`, applies no merge, and returns no heads.
```

